# 1. Introduction

The HoloJARVIS hardware platform is designed as a compact AI-powered holographic desktop assistant built around the Raspberry Pi 5.

The hardware combines:

- Artificial Intelligence
- Holographic Projection
- Computer Vision
- Voice Recognition
- Audio Playback
- Remote Computer Control
- Portable Power

into a single enclosure.

