# 6. Optical Hologram System

The holographic display uses a Pepper's Ghost-inspired optical projection system.

### Optical Stack

```
45° Reflective Glass

↓

100mm Watch Glass

↓

100mm Convex Lens

↓

2.4" TFT LCD
```

### Working Principle

1. LCD displays transparent AI animation.
2. Convex lens enlarges the image.
3. Watch glass improves optical clarity.
4. Reflective glass reflects the image.
5. User sees a floating holographic assistant.

