# 17. Troubleshooting

## Display Black

- Check SPI cable.
- Verify power.
- Check display driver.

---

## Camera Not Detected

- Verify CSI ribbon.
- Enable camera interface.
- Check ribbon orientation.

---

## No Audio

- Verify amplifier power.
- Check speaker polarity.
- Check software audio settings.

---

## Microphone Not Working

- Verify I2S wiring.
- Enable I2S.
- Test recording.

---

## Raspberry Pi Overheating

- Verify heatsink.
- Check fan.
- Improve airflow.

