# Hardware Summary

The HoloJARVIS hardware platform combines Raspberry Pi 5, holographic optics, voice input, camera vision, stereo audio, and portable power into a compact modular enclosure. Every component has been selected to support an AI-powered holographic assistant that is portable, serviceable, and ready for future hardware expansion while maintaining a clean internal architecture.
